legend bottom left
    <b>+</b> public    <b>-</b> private    <b>#</b> protected    <u>underlined</u> static
    Grey boxes belong to another package or library and are detailed elsewhere.
    A dashed arrow points to a class that this one calls or tests for.
    LoggingAspect wraps every public method of the controller, service and
    repository packages and writes the ENTER, EXIT and EXCEPTION lines.
    GlobalExceptionHandler writes the HANDLED line with the same error code.
    ERR-STOCK, ERR-NOTFOUND and ERR-VALIDATION are logged at WARN on one line;
    ERR-UNEXPECTED is logged at ERROR, with its stack trace once.
